<h1>DMS is not built yet</h1>

<p>The DMS web app (folder <code>ClientApp</code>) has not been compiled into <code>wwwroot/dms</code> on this server.</p>

<p>Run this once from the project folder (Node.js 18 or newer is needed), then reload this page:</p>

<pre>cd ClientApp
npm install
npm run build</pre>

<p class="muted">Or simply run <code>dotnet build -p:BuildClient=true</code>, which does the same.</p>
